  (text_box "U6 LDC1612 = DNP v2 footprint (unpopulated v1, spec 1/4.6). Coil = 14 mm spiral on CH0 (footprint retained, v2)."
    (at 196 240 0) (size 52 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1900cc8f-5edc-4dd2-b8ae-6c1a95e0f8c8)
  )
  (text_box "H08 ACTIVE (JP 2026-11-22): U12 BMM150 is POPULATED and feeds the BHY260AP rotation-vector\n(9-axis) fusion -> the logged quaternion depends on the magnetometer. NO permanent magnet,\nsteel fastener or magnetic latch near U12. Magnetic connectors REJECTED. Magnetic-base probe\nfixtures (PCBite-type) PROHIBITED on the bench rig. Add a layout keep-out around U12 and keep\nthe pogo/probe hardware non-magnetic. H08 was previously annotated N/A - that was stale."
    (at 196 240 0) (size 60 20)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid dcd380a3-3f63-4bad-b78c-779f35a4eb9c)
  )

